--!strict
--[[
	Short: hand-written translations for the one-word labels that stay too long in other languages even with two
	lines (a single word can't wrap): the nav tiles, the Exclusive shop's Featured tab, the leaderboard tabs, the
	Goals stage line and the daily tiles. Merijn's pick "A + C" (docs/translations.md).

	They are written into locale/Strings.csv as locale columns (scripts/gen-locale), so the place's own table
	answers them and the cloud table gets them as manual entries that Roblox automatic translation leaves alone.
	Column names are Roblox language codes; a player's locale falls back to them ("de-de" -> "de",
	"zh-cn" -> "zh-hans", "zh-tw" -> "zh-hant"; checked in Studio). Every translation keeps its source's
	parameters (Localize.checkManual). Written by the AI: a native speaker should check them.
]]

